7.1 this vs Custom Lock

| Feature                   | `this`       | Custom Lock |
| ------------------------- | ------------ | ----------- |
| Accessible Outside Class  | ✅ Yes        | ❌ No        |
| Encapsulation             | Low          | High        |
| Enterprise Preferred      | ❌ Usually No | ✅ Yes       |
| Risk of External Blocking | High         | Low         |


7.2 Synchronized Method vs this vs Custom Lock

| Feature                | Synchronized Method | `synchronized(this)` | `synchronized(lock)` |
| ---------------------- | ------------------- | -------------------- | -------------------- |
| Lock                   | `this`              | `this`               | Custom object        |
| Scope                  | Whole method        | Selected block       | Selected block       |
| Encapsulation          | Low                 | Low                  | High                 |
| Preferred for New Code | Sometimes           | Sometimes            | Often                |